  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water and a pinch of salt.\n• Cook penne in boiling water over high heat until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6665c0dceb556d0bf27f27bf-d7a9daa6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop onion and celery. Roughly chop tomato. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and celery until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium and add herby tomato seasoning, tomato and lentils. Cook until fragrant, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in passata, vegetable stock powder, reserved pasta water, the butter and brown sugar and cook until thickened, 2-3 mins. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6665c0dceb556d0bf27f27bf-4d559eb5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high. Add cooked pasta to frying pan and stir until well combined. Transfer to baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and grill until cheese has melted, 5-8 mins.\n• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6665c0dceb556d0bf27f27bf-3bf25082.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide hearty Italian lentil pasta bake and salad between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6665c0dceb556d0bf27f27bf-00d83811.jpeg"
    }
  ]
